{
  "name": "03 - BudgetFlow API Client / Search Transactions",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-0003",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Search Transactions\n\nSingle Responsibility: call GET /api/transactions (date-range/list search, not a single-record fetch by id — no such endpoint exists yet) and return a clean { ok, items, page, pageSize, totalItems, totalPages } contract. On failure, notifies 04 - Notifications / System Error itself — callers just check `ok`.\n\nRequires a BudgetFlow service API key with the `transactions:read` scope (BUDGETFLOW_SERVICE_API_KEY env var).\n\nConsumer: 02 - Processing / Duplicate Check.\n\nInput (all optional): { startDate?, endDate?, categoryId?, type?, search?, page?, pageSize? } — ISO date strings for startDate/endDate. pageSize defaults to 50 if not supplied.\nOutput (ok=true): { ok: true, items: [...], page, pageSize, totalItems, totalPages }\nOutput (ok=false): routes to System Error; caller sees whatever System Error's chain returns.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0002",
      "name": "On called",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": []
        },
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0004",
      "name": "GET Transactions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.BUDGETFLOW_BASE_URL + '/api/transactions' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + $env.BUDGETFLOW_SERVICE_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "startDate",
              "value": "={{ $json.startDate || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "endDate",
              "value": "={{ $json.endDate || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "categoryId",
              "value": "={{ $json.categoryId || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "type",
              "value": "={{ $json.type || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "search",
              "value": "={{ $json.search || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "page",
              "value": "={{ $json.page || 1 }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "pageSize",
              "value": "={{ $json.pageSize || 50 }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json",
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0005",
      "name": "Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0006",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode < 400 }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0007",
      "name": "Format Success Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1080,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "node-0008",
              "name": "ok",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": "={{ true }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "node-0009",
              "name": "items",
              "type": "array",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.items }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "node-0015",
              "name": "page",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.page }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "node-0016",
              "name": "pageSize",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.pageSize }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "node-0017",
              "name": "totalItems",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.totalItems }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "node-0018",
              "name": "totalPages",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.totalPages }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0010",
      "name": "Format System Error Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1080,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "node-0011",
              "name": "workflow",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "03 - BudgetFlow API Client / Search Transactions"
            },
            {
              "id": "node-0012",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body && $json.body.error) ? $json.body.error : 'GET /api/transactions failed' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "node-0013",
              "name": "statusCode",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.statusCode }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0014",
      "name": "Notify: System Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "SELECT_AFTER_IMPORT:04 - Notifications / System Error",
          "cachedResultName": "04 - Notifications / System Error"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "After importing, point this at the \"04 - Notifications / System Error\" workflow (n8n assigns IDs on import)."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
